{"kind":"task","id":".verify-flip-implement-ratta-rle","title":"Verify (FLIP 0.14): implement: RATTA_RLE encoder","description":"## FLIP Verification\n\nFLIP score 0.14 is below threshold 0.70 — independently verify this task.\n\n### Original Task\n**ID:** implement-ratta-rle\n**Title:** implement: RATTA_RLE encoder\n**Description:**\n\n```wg-contract\ntouch-set: [src/paia_supernote/ratta_rle.py, tests/test_ratta_rle.py]\nverify: uv run pytest tests/test_ratta_rle.py -v\n```\n\n```specdrift\nspec: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-04-14-paia-supernote-design.md\ncheck: does encoder produce output decodable by supernotelib's existing decoder? roundtrip test passes?\n```\n\nBuild the RATTA_RLE encoder. This is the critical-path component — nothing else in the write path works without it.\n\nReference: supernotelib's decoder source (the format spec is implicit in the decoder logic).\n\nColor codes:\n- 0x61 = black (ink)\n- 0x62 = background (white/cream)\n- 0x63 = dark gray\n- 0x64 = gray\n- 0x65 = light gray / white\n\nEncoding format: sequence of (colorcode, length) byte pairs. Special: length byte 0xff means 'next 2 bytes are big-endian uint16 length'.\n\nInput: PIL Image (1-bit or grayscale, 1404x1872)\nOutput: bytes — the RATTA_RLE encoded bitmap for a Supernote MAINLAYER\n\nTests must include:\n1. Roundtrip: encode → decode with supernotelib → pixel match\n2. All-black page encodes correctly\n3. All-white page encodes correctly\n4. Mixed content with long runs (triggers 0xff length marker)\n\nFile: src/paia_supernote/ratta_rle.py\n\n\n### Verification Instructions\nYou must independently verify whether the work was actually completed.\nDo NOT trust the original agent's claims. Check independently:\n\n1. Check `git log --oneline -10` for recent commits related to this task\n2. Check `git diff` to see if meaningful changes were made\n3. Run `cargo build && cargo test` to verify nothing is broken\n4. Verify any artifacts mentioned in the task description exist\n\n### Verdict\n- If verification **passes**: run `wg log 'implement-ratta-rle' \"FLIP verification passed (score 0.14)\"` and mark this task done.\n- If verification **fails**: run `wg fail 'implement-ratta-rle' --reason \"FLIP verification failed: <reason>\"` then mark this task done.\n","status":"failed","priority":10,"assigned":"agent-885","tags":["verification","agency","eval-scheduled"],"created_at":"2026-04-27T15:17:29.867355+00:00","started_at":"2026-04-27T15:20:38.377349+00:00","log":[{"timestamp":"2026-04-27T15:20:38.377355+00:00","actor":"agent-885","message":"Spawned by wg spawn --executor claude --model opus"},{"timestamp":"2026-04-27T15:21:34.943573+00:00","actor":"agent-885","message":"Task marked as failed: Agent exited with code 1"}],"retry_count":1,"max_retries":1,"failure_reason":"Agent exited with code 1","model":"opus","exec_mode":"light"}
